### Phase 3: Classroom Service HTTP Verification Collection
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@classroomServiceDirect = http://localhost:8082
@internalKey = your_internal_service_key_for_backend_services_only

### 1. Teacher Login
# @name teacherLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "prof.smith@university.edu",
  "password": "TeacherPassword123!"
}

### 2. Student Login
# @name studentLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice.student@university.edu",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 3. Teacher Creates a New Classroom
@teacherToken = {{teacherLogin.response.body.token}}
# @name createClass
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/classes
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Computer Networks & Distributed Systems",
  "description": "TCP/IP, HTTP/3, consensus algorithms, and microservices architecture"
}

### 4. Student Lists Classes (Before Enrollment)
@studentToken = {{studentLogin.response.body.token}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/classes
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 5. Student Requests to Join Classroom
@classId = {{createClass.response.body.id}}
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/classes/{{classId}}/join
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 6. Teacher Views Pending Join Requests
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/classes/{{classId}}/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

### 7. Teacher Approves Student Join Request
@studentId = {{studentLogin.response.body.userId}}
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/classes/{{classId}}/requests/{{studentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ACCEPTED"
}

### 8. Student Views Enrolled Class Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/classes/{{classId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 9. Student / Teacher Views Class Roster
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/classes/{{classId}}/roster
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 10. Internal S2S: Assessment Service Verifies Student Enrollment (Direct to :8082)
GET {{classroomServiceDirect}}/internal/classes/{{classId}}/verify-student/{{studentId}}
X-Internal-Token: {{internalKey}}

### 11. Internal S2S: Assessment Service Verifies Teacher Ownership (Direct to :8082)
@teacherId = {{teacherLogin.response.body.userId}}
GET {{classroomServiceDirect}}/internal/classes/{{classId}}/verify-teacher/{{teacherId}}
X-Internal-Token: {{internalKey}}

### 12. Internal S2S: Assessment Service Fetches Class Roster for Notifications (Direct to :8082)
GET {{classroomServiceDirect}}/internal/classes/{{classId}}/roster
X-Internal-Token: {{internalKey}}

### 13. Security Test: Internal Route Blocked at Gateway (Should return 403 Forbidden)
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/classes/{{classId}}/roster
X-Internal-Token: {{internalKey}}
